🛒 E-Commerce Customer Segmentation & Recommendation Engine — Project Overview
1. Business Problem

E-commerce companies generate large volumes of customer transaction data but often struggle to understand:

Who their most valuable customers are and how to retain them.
Which customers are at risk of becoming inactive due to reduced purchasing behavior.
When customers are most likely to shop to optimize marketing campaigns and inventory planning.
Which products perform best across different regions and customer segments.
How to provide personalized product recommendations to increase customer engagement and sales.

The business needed a data-driven approach to segment customers, identify sales patterns, analyze product performance, and recommend relevant products to improve customer retention and revenue growth.

